menu "SingleCAN Configuration"

    config SINGLECAN_TRUSTED_PEER_ADDRESS
        string "Trusted Classic Bluetooth peer address"
        default ""
        help
            Classic Bluetooth address authorized to own the SingleCAN
            SPP command session.

            Use the canonical format XX:XX:XX:XX:XX:XX.

            Leave this value empty only for an intentionally
            unprovisioned development or manufacturing image. An empty
            value does not authorize the first connecting peer.

            At runtime, the configured address must also remain present
            in the ESP-IDF Classic Bluetooth bonded-device database.

endmenu
